    modified_response: "I have integrated the design specifications and HTML structures into the **ARIS | Athlete Recovery & Performance Intelligence** web application:\n\n- **Aesthetic Identity**: Implemented the glassmorphism dark theme (`#131313`) accented with electric neon lime (`#C3F400`), high-contrast alert indicators, and Oswald/Inter typography pairing.\n- **High Risk Alerts**: Displays critical athlete strain and injury risk notifications (e.g., Rohit, Sandeep, Bharath) with fatigue trend metrics and load adjustment alerts.\n- **Athlete Roster Management**: Interactive table listing squad members with real-time status badges (`CRITICAL`, `MODERATE`, `OPTIMAL`), 7-day sparkline fatigue trends, recovery meters, and one-click actions (**Assign Rest**, **Modify Load**).\n- **Match Readiness Recommendations**: Clear categorization for match availability\342\200\224*Cleared to Play*, *Cleared with Caution*, and *Not Cleared* with medical clearance reasons.\n- **Bento Stats Overview**: Team readiness gauge (72%), injury risk indicators, HRV baseline tracking, and real-time optimization meters.\n- **Full Navigation**: Navigation bar supporting Dashboard, Recovery Protocols, AI Diagnostic assistant, Biometric Survey logging, and Squad Profiles."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
